# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Trees that are gone, and the untracked output they left behind
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The network emulation harness that used to live in experiments/ was replaced
# by the `core` regime of test/ (docs/adr/core-emulation-2026.md); the Shadow
# tree before it was retired earlier still. Their tracked content is in git
# history. What may still sit on a developer's machine is the raw run output
# neither of them ever tracked -- hundreds of megabytes per campaign -- so both
# paths stay ignored: not because anything writes there any more, but so that
# an old tree cannot be committed back by accident.
experiments/
shadow/

# The harness's own run output is ignored by test/results/.gitignore, next to
# the runs themselves, so that the rule lives where the thing it describes is.
